ens#English\" title=\"womens\">womens</a></span></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading4\"><h4 id=\"Synonyms\">Synonyms</h4><span class=\"mw-editsection\" data-nosnippet=\"\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=woman&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Synonyms\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"en\"><a href=\"/wiki/lady#English\" title=\"lady\">lady</a></span>; <span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"en\"><a href=\"/wiki/female#English\" title=\"female\">female</a></span>; <i>see more at</i> <a href=\"/wiki/Thesaurus:woman\" title=\"Thesaurus:woman\">Thesaurus:woman</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading4\"><h4 id=\"Hypernyms\">Hypernyms</h4><span class=\"mw-editsection\" data-nosnippet=\"\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=woman&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Hypernyms\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"en\"><a href=\"/wiki/man#English\" title=\"man\">man</a></span> <span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content qualifier-content\">broad sense</span><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">)</span>, <span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"en\"><a href=\"/wiki/human#English\" title=\"human\">human</a></span></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading4\"><h4 id=\"Hyponyms\">Hyponyms</h4><span class=\"mw-editsection\" data-nosnippet=\"\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=woman&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Hyponyms\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"list-switcher-wrapper\"><div class=\"list-switcher list-switcher-collapsed\" data-toggle-category=\"derived terms\"><div class=\"term-list columns-bg ul-column-count\" data-column-coun