 nalezl.</span><dl><dd><span class=\"e-translation\">A substance similar to starch seems to be the elecampine (inulinum) which already P. Vauquelin has found in the root of the officinal inula (<i>Inula helenium</i>).</span></dd></dl></div></dd></dl></div></li></ul></li></ol>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading4\"><h4 id=\"Declension\">Declension</h4><span class=\"mw-editsection\" data-nosnippet=\"\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=woman&amp;action=edit&amp;section=23\" title=\"Edit section: Declension\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"NavFrame\" style=\"max-width:45em\">\n<div class=\"NavHead\" style=\"background: var(--wikt-palette-lighterblue, #ebf4ff); cursor: pointer;\"><span class=\"NavToggle\" data-nosnippet=\"\"><a role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\">show ▼</a></span>Declension of <i lang=\"cs\">woman</i> (<span style=\"font-size: smaller;\">hard masculine inanimate</span>)</div>\n<div class=\"NavContent\" style=\"overflow: auto; display: none;\">\n<table style=\"min-width:45em\" class=\"inflection-table inflection\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"rowgroup\">\n<th style=\"width:33%;background:var(--wikt-palette-lightblue, #d9ebff);\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"background:var(--wikt-palette-lightblue, #d9ebff);\">singular\n</th>\n<th style=\"background:var(--wikt-palette-lightblue, #d9ebff);\">plural\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"background:var(--wikt-palette-lighterblue, #ebf4ff);\">nominative\n</th>\n<td><span class=\"Latn form-of lang-cs nom|s-form-of origin-woman\" lang=\"cs\"><strong class=\"selflink\">woman</strong></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"Latn form-of lang-cs nom|p-form-of origin-woman\" lang=\"cs\"><a href=\"/wiki/womany#Czech\" title=\"womany\">womany</a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"background:var(--wikt-palette-lighterblue, #ebf4ff);\">genitive\n</th>\n<td><span class=\"Latn form-of lang-cs gen|s-form-of origin-woman\" lang=\"cs\"><a h